      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "WHY LEADERSHIP CAN TRUST IT",
      "originalText": "WHY LEADERSHIP CAN TRUST IT",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "text_115",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 86,
      "y": 578,
      "width": 2916,
      "height": 19,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#5c3a00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 92541696,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1225148224,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1752624000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "1) Every threshold is TAGGED with its origin — library (MASTER), a person (USER) or the model (ML).      2) Assessments are IMMUTABLE: a re-run adds a new row, it never overwrites (cov_threshold_audit & cov_covenant_status_audit are append-only).      3) A breach is never erased — a Waiver/Extension is layered on top, so who-waived-what-when is always on record.",
      "originalText": "1) Every threshold is TAGGED with its origin — library (MASTER), a person (USER) or the model (ML).      2) Assessments are IMMUTABLE: a re-run adds a new row, it never overwrites (cov_threshold_audit & cov_covenant_status_audit are append-only).      3) A breach is never erased — a Waiver/Extension is layered on top, so who-waived-what-when is always on record.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14
    },
